MODULE: DIAGNOSTIC_PLACEMENT_ENGINE

OBJECTIVE:
Assess learner readiness across AFOQT quantitative domains and assign a personalized starting path.

INPUTS:
- Accuracy
- TimePerQuestion
- ConfidenceRating
- ErrorType
- ConceptTag
- HesitationTime

ASSESSMENT_AREAS:
- ArithmeticFluency
- Fractions
- Decimals
- Percentages
- Ratios
- AlgebraReadiness
- GeometryReadiness
- WordProblemReasoning
- MentalMathSpeed

OUTPUTS:
- StartingRegion
- WeaknessMap
- ConfidenceProfile
- DailyTrainingPlan
- RemediationPath

RULES:
- DoNotOverwhelmUser
- PreferConfidenceBuildingStart
- DetectPrerequisiteGaps
- SeparateKnowledgeFailureFromSpeedFailure
